    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the New Inlet, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey and the Department of Commerce. Surveyed in 1978; aerial photographs from 1975; field checked in 1978; last revised in 1981; printed in 1983.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 24 x 28.9 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
